  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan already treats the inheritance owner as a rank four righteous Gu Master before he enters the halls.",
      "chapters": [
        214
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "sys_righteous_path"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A human skeleton sits in the cave before a huge bone book.",
      "chapters": [
        222
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a later hall he and Bai Ning Bing find a sitting skeleton before a huge bone book. The book holds refinement recipes, the creator’s life experiences, and why the inheritance was set up, and it states that the corpse is Grey Bone Scholar himself.",
      "chapters": [
        222
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "corpse-and-name",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_bai_ning_bing"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Bai clan elders who open the same book treat the site as a righteous path inheritance.",
      "chapters": [
        223
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "corpse-and-name",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_bai_clan_bai_gu_mountain"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A Flesh Sac Secret Chamber text invites a fated successor to knock the teeth in the mouths on the flesh walls; if luck opens the teeth, they can take the Gu worm hibernating inside. The same text names his two identities as Grey Bone Scholar and Flesh Bone Master.",
      "chapters": [
        224
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "secret-chamber",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_flesh_sac_secret_chamber",
        "sys_gu_worms"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A scroll on his tomb pyramid states that he lacked high aptitude and spent his life trying to invent a cultivation Gu that ordinary Gu Masters could use widely. Near death he left the unfinished bone flesh unity Gu concept, materials, and forge for a fated successor, asking that any result be conveyed to his gravestone.",
      "chapters": [
        226
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "bone-flesh-unity-gu",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_gu_masters",
        "gu_bone_flesh_unity_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan judges the flower wine monk a cut above Grey Bone Scholar in rank, yet still ranks his own gains from this site above the flower wine inheritance, because this mountain setup was planned for a long time while the other was completed in haste.",
      "chapters": [
        228
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "inheritance-comparison",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bai Ning Bing sighs that the world holds so many great geniuses; the next line treats Grey Bone Scholar as a true genius for inventing that Gu while only a rank four Gu Master.",
      "chapters": [
        231
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "genius-praise",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_master"
      ]
    }
  ],
